FastPin vendors GPL-3.0-or-later Rust crates from Snow Shot
(https://github.com/mg-chao/snow-shot) and contains code ported from snow-shot
across image stitching/collage, image splitting, capture history, colour picking,
scroll stepping, adaptive capture cadence and other modules:

    Snow Crates - shared Rust libraries and C ABI components for Snow Apps.
    Copyright (C) 2026 mg-chao
    SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

    crates/snow-stitch-images/, crates/snow-memory/ and crates/snow-ui-selector/
    are derived from snow-crates/ in the Snow Shot repository; the additional
    modules listed above are ported into FastPin itself. In particular the
    region picker's window+element detection now calls the vendored
    snow-ui-selector directly, so it shares snow-shot's UIA/MSAA backends,
    window spatial index, per-monitor clipping and two-phase queries. See
    COPYRIGHT.snow-shot and the LICENSE files inside those crate directories
    for full notices.

